:: CatholicCW {"position":"450,50","size":"100,100"}
The main character of the game is a 3rd generation diaspora Puerto Rican who lives in a fictional Park Slope, New York and then migrated to a suburban New Jersey. A lot of Puerto Ricans are Catholic, so there will be mentions of saint statues, crosses, churches, and prayers. 

However, religion does not play a main role in this game and the character identifies as secular but culturally Catholic. Catholicism is a common motif in Latin American and Caribbean cultures. Even when the Latino is not neccessarily a church-going Catholic, they might be rocking that Mary tattoo because she is aesthetically cool to them.

[[Return->Epigram]] 


