:: DadDedication {"position":"2700,700","size":"100,100"}
This is kind of a weird game to dedicate to your Dad. Pieces of this game is based off histories I've read and never got a chance to ask him about. My father is the descendent of two Chinese, possibly both from the Shantou region, of Fujian/Teochew origin. They are Tan Peck Sim and Ng Liat Seng and they left China for Singapore during the Sino-Japanese Wars.  

Ng Liat Seng, my ah gong, was a coal merchant. In the long house that the Ng family lived in with several others. my baba lived through the economic expansions and post-British colonial conditions of Lee Kuan Yew. Indepedent Singapore changed drastically and my baba made several homes as a culinary chef: Singapore, Bermuda, Brooklyn, and New Jersey. He continues to rest in New Jersey. He is known by many names: Danny Ng. Danny Ming. Dan. Miang Hui Ng.  Daddy. Dad. Hui Miang Ng. But he is born:

Ng Hui Miang 


August 21st 1956 - August 16th 2011

Further Note: Wang Jiafei is entirely fictional for the most part. He is not based off my dad, with the exception of the packages with various names. My dad did that and I never had a chance to ask why.

Miss you, Dad. 



